config BR2_PACKAGE_SMT_AUDIO_DSP
	bool "smt-audio-dsp"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_PLUGINS
	help
	  Custom LADSPA plugin (smt_hpf_limiter) for the SMT1019's 2 W
	  built-in speaker: a 4th-order Butterworth high-pass followed by
	  a makeup-gain tanh soft-limiter.

	  The high-pass removes the sub-~200 Hz content the small woofer
	  over-excurses on; the makeup gain + soft limiter raise music RMS
	  toward the digital ceiling for loudness without hard clipping.

	  Installs /usr/lib/ladspa/smt_audio_dsp.so, loaded by the ALSA
	  `type ladspa` PCM plugin (alsa-plugins) via /etc/asound.conf so
	  every audio stream is filtered transparently.
